  <text>
    <status value="extensions"/><div xml:lang="fr" lang="fr"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class="res-header-id"><b>Narratif généré : DéfinitionStructure xdmAuthorSubmissionSet</b></p><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="xhtTableBorder0"><tr class="xhtRowBorder1"><th scope="col" style="" class="hierarchy xhtCellBorder0"><a href="https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views" title="Le nom logique de l'élément">Nom</a></th><th scope="col" style="" class="hierarchy xhtCellBorder0"><a href="https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views" title="Informations sur l'utilisation de l'élément">Drapeaux</a></th><th scope="col" style="" class="hierarchy xhtCellBorder0"><a href="https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views" title="Nombre minimum et maximum de fois que l'élément peut apparaître dans l'instance">Card.</a></th><th scope="col" style="; width: 100px" class="hierarchy xhtCellBorder0"><a href="https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views" title="Référence au type de l'élément">Type</a></th><th scope="col" style="" class="hierarchy xhtCellBorder0"><a href="https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views" title="Informations supplémentaires sur l'élément">Description et contraintes</a><span style="float: right"><a href="https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views" title="Legend for this format"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="doco" style="background-color: inherit"/></a></span></th></tr><tr class="xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven"><td style="background-image: url(tbl_bck1.png)" class="hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap"><img src="tbl_spacer.png" alt="" style="background-color: inherit" class="hierarchy"/><img src="icon_element.gif" alt="" style="background-color: white; background-color: inherit" title="Element" class="hierarchy"/> <a href="StructureDefinition-xdmAuthorSubmissionSet-definitions.html#xdmAuthorSubmissionSet" title="Modèle logique d'un auteur d'un lot de soumission
Cette métadonnée représente les personnes physiques et/ou les systèmes auteurs d’un lot de soumission. 
Constituée des sous-attributs **authorInstitution**, **authorPerson**, **authorRole** et **authorSpecialty**, elle ne porte pas de valeur par elle-même. ">xdmAuthorSubmissionSet</a><a name="xdmAuthorSubmissionSet"> </a></td><td style="" class="hierarchy xhtCellBorder0"/><td style="" class="hierarchy xhtCellBorder0"><span class="xhtPieceDeEmphasized">0</span><span class="xhtPieceDeEmphasized">..</span><span class="xhtPieceDeEmphasized">*</span></td><td style="" class="hierarchy xhtCellBorder0"><a href="StructureDefinition-xdmAuthor.html">XDMAuthor(0.1.0-ballot)</a></td><td style="" class="hierarchy xhtCellBorder0">XDM AuthorSubmissionSet<br/><br/>Éléments définis dans les ancêtres :<a href="StructureDefinition-xdmAuthor.html" title="Cet attribut représente la structure de l’auteur.">institution</a>, <a href="StructureDefinition-xdmAuthor.html" title="Author">person[x]</a>, <a href="StructureDefinition-xdmAuthor.html" title="**Author Role**">role</a>, <a href="StructureDefinition-xdmAuthor.html" title="**AutorSpecialty**">specialty</a></td></tr>
<tr class="xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd"><td style="background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)" class="hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap"><img src="tbl_spacer.png" alt="" style="background-color: inherit" class="hierarchy"/><img src="tbl_vjoin.png" alt="" style="background-color: inherit" class="hierarchy"/><img src="icon_element.gif" alt="" style="background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit" title="Element" class="hierarchy"/> <span style="position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0" class="sr-only">xdmAuthorSubmissionSet.</span><a href="StructureDefinition-xdmAuthorSubmissionSet-definitions.html#xdmAuthorSubmissionSet.institution">institution</a><a name="xdmAuthorSubmissionSet.institution"> </a></td><td style="" class="hierarchy xhtCellBorder0"/><td style="" class="hierarchy xhtCellBorder0"><span class="xhtPieceDeEmphasized">0</span><span class="xhtPieceDeEmphasized">..</span><span class="xhtPieceDeEmphasized">1</span></td><td style="" class="hierarchy xhtCellBorder0"><a href="StructureDefinition-xdmAuthorInstitution.html" class="xhtPieceDeEmphasized">xdmAuthorInstitution</a></td><td style="" class="hierarchy xhtCellBorder0">Cette métadonnée représente la structure émettrice du lot de soumission</td></tr>
<tr class="xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven"><td style="background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)" class="hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap"><img src="tbl_spacer.png" alt="" style="background-color: inherit" class="hierarchy"/><img src="tbl_vjoin.png" alt="" style="background-color: inherit" class="hierarchy"/><img src="icon_element.gif" alt="" style="background-color: white; background-color: inherit" title="Element" class="hierarchy"/> <span style="position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0" class="sr-only">xdmAuthorSubmissionSet.</span><a href="StructureDefinition-xdmAuthorSubmissionSet-definitions.html#xdmAuthorSubmissionSet.person[x]">person[x]</a><a name="xdmAuthorSubmissionSet.person_x_"> </a></td><td style="" class="hierarchy xhtCellBorder0"/><td style="" class="hierarchy xhtCellBorder0"><span class="xhtPieceDeEmphasized">1</span><span class="xhtPieceDeEmphasized">..</span><span class="xhtPieceDeEmphasized">1</span></td><td style="" class="hierarchy xhtCellBorder0"><a href="StructureDefinition-xdmActorPs.html" class="xhtPieceDeEmphasized">xdmActorPs</a><span class="xhtPieceDeEmphasized">, </span><a href="StructureDefinition-xdmActorPatient.html" class="xhtPieceDeEmphasized">xdmActorPatient</a><span class="xhtPieceDeEmphasized">, </span><a href="StructureDefinition-xdmActorSystem.html" class="xhtPieceDeEmphasized">xdmActorSystem</a></td><td style="" class="hierarchy xhtCellBorder0">Cette métadonnée représente la personne physique ou le système émetteur du lot de soumission.Pour les documents d’expression personnelle du patient, cette métadonnée fait référence au patient.</td></tr>
<tr class="xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd"><td style="background-image: url(tbl_bck00.png)" class="hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap"><img src="tbl_spacer.png" alt="" style="background-color: inherit" class="hierarchy"/><img src="tbl_vjoin_end.png" alt="" style="background-color: inherit" class="hierarchy"/><img src="icon_element.gif" alt="" style="background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit" title="Element" class="hierarchy"/> <span style="position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0" class="sr-only">xdmAuthorSubmissionSet.</span><a href="StructureDefinition-xdmAuthorSubmissionSet-definitions.html#xdmAuthorSubmissionSet.role">role</a><a name="xdmAuthorSubmissionSet.role"> </a></td><td style="" class="hierarchy xhtCellBorder0"/><td style="" class="hierarchy xhtCellBorder0"><span class="xhtPieceDeEmphasized">0</span><span class="xhtPieceDeEmphasized">..</span><span class="xhtPieceDeEmphasized">*</span></td><td style="" class="hierarchy xhtCellBorder0"><a href="http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#CodeableConcept" class="xhtPieceDeEmphasized">CodeableConcept</a></td><td style="" class="hierarchy xhtCellBorder0">Cette métadonnée représente le rôle joué par l’auteur vis-à-vis du patient lors de la constitution du lot de soumission, c'est-à-dire à quel titre l’auteur est intervenu vis-à-vis du patient (ex : médecin traitant, Responsable de l'admission, Membre de l'équipe de soins, etc.).</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="5" class="hierarchy"><br/><a href="https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views" title="Légende pour ce format"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="doco" style="background-color: inherit"/> Documentation pour ce format</a></td></tr></table></div>
  </text>
